# Heartfire Hero's valiant counts only spells and abilities ITS CONTROLLER controls, and its death trigger reads its power as it
# last was on the battlefield (CR 603.2, 608.2h, 113.7a). Turn 1: Bot1 casts the Hero and Basilisk Collar and pays equip {2},
# which targets the Hero: valiant puts a +1/+1 counter on it (a 2/2). Turn 2: Bot2 Lightning Bolts the Hero. That targeting is
# not Bot1's, so valiant does not trigger again (the stack holds only the Bolt, and the counter count stays 1). The Bolt kills
# the 2/2, and its death trigger deals 2 (its last power, counter included) to Bot2, who goes from 20 to 18. The Collar gave it
# lifelink, which it still has as it last existed (CR 702.15b, 608.2h), so Bot1 gains 2 (22).

